#: contents/ui/configLocation.qml:428
msgid ""
"Auto-detect estimates your location from your public IP address via "
"Mullvad's geolocation endpoint (am.i.mullvad.net — a privacy focused, no-"
"logging service). Your IP is sent to Mullvad to do this, but won't be stored "
"or profiled. It's approximate, city-level, not precise location."
